## 8. List resources and `terraform query`

Terraform >= 1.14. A list resource enumerates existing objects of a managed
resource type on the daemon. Put `list` blocks in a `*.tfquery.hcl` file next
to the configuration and run `terraform query`; add
`-generate-config-out=imported.tf` to write `import` blocks plus resource
configuration for the results, which is the way to adopt unmanaged
containers, networks or services in bulk.

```terraform
# discover.tfquery.hcl
list "docker_container" "all" {
  provider = docker
  # include_resource = true # return full resource objects, not just identities
  # limit            = 100
  config {
    # filters from reference/list.docker_container.md
  }
}
```
